abstract: >-
  Curated reproducibility package for the manuscript "Source-Aware Evaluation
  of RTL Area and Timing Prediction with Prospective Confirmation." The
  repository contains compact frozen prediction-level data, manuscript-facing
  evidence tables, closure records and scripts for checking reported metrics,
  while deliberately excluding the full historical research archive and
  third-party RTL whose redistribution rights are uncertain. Source code is
  licensed under MIT; original data tables, prediction records, result tables,
  metadata and documentation are licensed under CC BY 4.0 as specified in the
  repository licensing files.
